Welcome to the TOS 2.06 user-guide!
This guide will try to fully explain how to use and take advantage 
of TOS 2.06's many features, previously unexplained properly.


Getting started
---------------
Simple! 

1) Start your graphical web browser ("Lynx" etc. won't do as the guide 
relies on countless illustrations -consider it an alternative to a paper 
based guide).

2) Open the file named "INDEX.HTM". You'll find it in the same folder 
as this text file.


Background image problem
------------------------
The guide has been designed to work on any computer with a graphical 
web browser, which is why the file-names all stick to the 8+3 naming 
standard, making it possible to view on a standard ST with TOS. 

Each page also contains a background image. This was designed for 
colour systems, so if you're viewing the guide on a standard ST you're 
most likely to see a messy background. On other computers however it 
should look good.

If you're experiencing problems you can disable the background image 
in a few simple steps:

1) Open the "IMAGES" folder within this guide
2) Locate a file called "BACKGND.GIF".
3) Rename this file to something else (i.e. "BACKGND.GI_", "BACKGND.GIX" etc.)

From then on you can view the guide without any background image 
messing up the display.


Enjoy the guide! 


